# Witness: a corpus that has stopped quoting the suite total

The split, the Native AOT image size and the trimmed image size are all still quoted and still
correct. Only the suite total has gone, which a guard that compares no value would not notice.

The run was 90 architecture tests and 131 behavioural tests, the fixtures host publishes and
runs as a Native AOT binary of 1,279,488 bytes, and it also runs as a 162,816-byte trimmed
binary.
